WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.600
Share your location, essential equipment and the power issue you want to solve.

00:00:02.600 --> 00:00:05.200
The company reviews the request and confirms the assessment fee and appointment before a physical visit.

00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:07.800
After the site review, a proposal describes the agreed system before installation begins.
